    notice='''<article class="card"><b>Insurance and legal requirements vary by business activity and location.</b><p class="muted">These recommendations are provided for business-planning and educational purposes. Confirm coverage and legal requirements with a licensed insurance professional, attorney, or appropriate government agency.</p></article><section><h2>How Recommendations Are Classified</h2><div class="grid"><article class="card"><h3>Required by Law</h3><p>Shown only when an official government or regulatory source supports the requirement for the known location and circumstances.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Required by Contract, Venue, or Lender</h3><p>May be required by a client, landlord, venue, lender, or business partner even when it is not a general legal requirement.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Recommended Protection</h3><p>May help manage a business risk but is not presented as legally required.</p></article><article class="card"><h3>Needs Professional Review</h3><p>The available facts are not enough for a reliable conclusion; confirm with a licensed professional or the appropriate agency.</p></article></div></section>'''
    search=f'''<section id="insurance-search"><article class="card"><h2>Find Business Insurance</h2><p class="muted">Search provider websites using your business activity, industry, location, employees, operating model, and selected coverage. Results are comparisons—not “best company” rankings. Prices, premiums, deductibles, limits, and coverage are never invented.</p><form method="post"><label>Coverage or risk</label><input class="input" name="coverage" value="{html.escape(coverage,quote=True)}" placeholder="Example: professional liability"><label>Business location</label><input class="input" name="location" value="{html.escape(location,quote=True)}"><button class="btn">Search Insurance Providers</button></form></article>{('<div class="notice">Some sources could not be reached; remaining sources were still checked.</div>' if errors else '')}<div class="grid">{provider_cards}</div></section>'''
    return page('Business Insurance & Legal Protection',f'''<div class="hero"><span class="badge">BUSINESS DEVELOPMENT • 10</span><h1>Business Insurance & Legal Protection</h1><p><b>Understand the insurance and basic legal protections your business may need.</b></p><p class="muted">Recommendations use your saved Business Plan and distinguish possible legal duties, contract requirements, recommended protection, and matters needing professional review.</p><div class="actions"><a class="out" href="{url_for('business_plan')}#protection">View in Business Journal</a><a class="out" href="{url_for('business_certifications')}">Licenses & Certifications</a></div></div>{notice}<section><h2>My Business Protection Review</h2><div class="grid">{review}</div></section>{search}<section id="legal-checklist"><h2>My Business Legal Checklist</h2><div class="grid">{''.join(checklist_cards)}</div></section>''','business')

